[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3605.19, "timestamp": "01:00:05", "text": "不。等等，等等，等等，等等。告訴我導航提示。哦，天哪。等等。好了，菜單在這裡。哦，謝天謝地。哦，它在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3635.19, "timestamp": "01:00:35", "text": "好的，就這麼放著。不錯。我們還修復了什麼？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3637.43, "timestamp": "01:00:37", "text": "嗯，好的。沒問題。沒問題。我們現在回來了。嗯，好的。發布。為了確保萬無一失，還是發布一下吧。嗨。哦，對了"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3648.71, "timestamp": "01:00:48", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "natives"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 3655.519, "timestamp": "01:00:55", "author": "@aniketwande4403", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_m_Z2M4vVHkWPdw0fzo-i-Dy4Pm4-b-bs22Utnn5zkWBHY=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "native indians"}]